      "name": "What is Naimish Nagar Yojana Lucknow?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Naimish Nagar Yojana is India's first education-focused LDA township — 785 acres in Barabanki district, 30 km from Lucknow. It features 6,000+ residential plots, 150+ acres dedicated to universities and educational institutions (3 MOUs signed), smart city infrastructure, and planned population of 2.5 lakh. It is uniquely positioned to serve students, educators, and families seeking education-anchored real estate investment."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "@id": "https://dsdproperties.in/blog/naimish-nagar-yojana-lucknow-lda-plots-guide-2026#faq-2",
      "name": "Where exactly is Naimish Nagar in Barabanki?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Naimish Nagar is located in Barabanki district, 30 km from Lucknow city center via Lucknow-Barabanki Road. It sits in the rapidly developing Lucknow-Barabanki corridor with direct access to National Highway 56 and Lucknow's outer ring road (Kisan Path)."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
