      "name": "How many plots will Naimish Nagar have?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "LDA has confirmed more than 6,000 residential plots across EWS, LIG, MIG, and HIG categories. Additional commercial and institutional plots will be available. Exact plot count will be finalized in the detailed layout plan."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "@id": "https://dsdproperties.in/blog/naimish-nagar-yojana-lucknow-lda-plots-guide-2026#faq-4",
      "name": "What is the 150-acre education zone in Naimish Nagar?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "A dedicated 150+ acre zone exclusively for universities, colleges, research institutions, skill development centers, and student housing facilities. Three major educational institutions have signed MOUs as of February 2026, confirming this zone's implementation and viability."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "@id": "https://dsdproperties.in/blog/naimish-nagar-yojana-lucknow-lda-plots-guide-2026#faq-5",
      "name": "Has the Naimish Nagar lottery been announced?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "No. As of April 2026, Naimish Nagar is in Phase 2 development. Phase 1 land acquisition (260 acres) is complete. Phase 2 infrastructure development is starting. Public lottery announcement is expected in 2026-2027. Monitor ldalucknow.in for official registration dates."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "@id": "https://dsdproperties.in/blog/naimish-nagar-yojana-lucknow-lda-plots-guide-2026#faq-6",
      "name": "Is it safe to buy land near Naimish Nagar right now?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Exercise caution. Land in acquisition areas may be subject to LDA proceedings. Always verify Khatauni status at upbhulekh.gov.in, check LDA acquisition status, get an Encumbrance Certificate, and confirm no government claims. Professional verification is strongly recommended before any transaction."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "@id": "https://dsdproperties.in/blog/naimish-nagar-yojana-lucknow-lda-plots-guide-2026#faq-7",
      "name": "What makes Naimish Nagar different from IT City and Wellness City?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Three key differences: (1) Education-focused — 150+ acres for universities versus IT companies (IT City) or hospitals (Wellness City). (2) Located in Barabanki district, not on Sultanpur Road. (3) Features university anchor institutions with signed MOUs — creating permanent academic demand unlike corporate campus models."
      }
    },
