      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "No official pricing announced as of April 2026. Based on LDA pattern, expect launch pricing 30-50% below prevailing market rates. Land near Lucknow-Barabanki Road ranges from ₹1,500 to ₹3,500 per sqft. LDA plots will be significantly lower. Exact pricing will be announced with lottery."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "@id": "https://dsdproperties.in/blog/naimish-nagar-yojana-lucknow-lda-plots-guide-2026#faq-9",
      "name": "Is Naimish Nagar a good investment in 2026?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Naimish Nagar has exceptional fundamentals — India's first education township, university anchors, smart city standards, ₹3,000 crore allocated. But it is a 5-7 year horizon investment. Infrastructure development just starting. Expect first plot allotments in 2026-2027. Best for patient investors and education professionals. Always verify before paying."
      }
    },
